        <mxCell id="gap" value="THE GAP&#10;&#10;PROSE IS NOT A SHAPE.&#10;willows-grove extracted to 790 claims:&#10;706 docstrings, 84 table terms,&#10;5 rows from docs/design/.&#10;&#10;The missing extractor is the Forge's&#10;keyword scan (shape doc 3) pointed at&#10;a file. Two callers, one component.&#10;It must emit an origin." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="470" width="290" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="rev" value="REVISIONS&#10;&#10;2026-08-30  first draft. Five extractors written in one&#10;            night; corpus 11,061 -> 16,223, 24 -> 48 sources.&#10;            kb.db held back: rows marked open still name&#10;            personal projects. Operator call outstanding.&#10;            .willow excluded on the record, not by omission.&#10;&#10;OPEN: prose lane; PR deposit; 5 org .github repos yield&#10;      nothing under the standard shapes." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="760" width="480" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

